      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the context before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has an unused `DELTA` constant and sparse documentation. I'll improve understandability by: removing the unused constant, clarifying the Javadoc to explain the edge-case contract being tested, adding a `@DisplayName`, and adding a descriptive assertion message.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes the unused `DELTA` constant, adds a class-level `@DisplayName` and clearer Javadoc explaining the zero-width range contract, introduces a named variable `startAndEnd` to make the intent of passing the same value for both bounds explicit, and adds a descriptive failure message to the assertion."
